37584>>>        Else Begin
37585>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
37586>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
37587>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
37588>>>        End
