37783>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37784>>>                Case Break
37785>>>
37785>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37785>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
37785>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
37785>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37786>>>
37786>>>        Case End
37786>>>
